"The lobby holds a desk with a golden tray of pens, leather armchairs, sofas and potted plants."
"The lobby has free WiFi, a vending machine and elevators with shoe cubbies beside them."
"Gorgon has worked the desk some forty years, since trying to disembowel a powerful Artonan."
"Gorgon can reach every public area of the building, does janitorial work and has no room."
"Gorgon registers new Avowed with Earth's governments and hands each a free ballpoint pen."
"Registration ceremonies bring in families, friends and sometimes news crews."
"The consulate has faced two attempted bombings and several enraged superhumans."
"A small ballroom with a huge screen serves as a classroom; teachers beam in from Artona."
"The wordchain classroom is laid with yoga-mat pads."
"The basement, for official Artonan use only, is reached by an elevator keyed to a System sigil."
"The basement hallway is all beige, lit by buzzing fluorescent lights."
"The trading room is a small gray office with a milky white crystal table and one folding chair."
"Selectees trade classes at the crystal table, with Gorgon as their authorized witness."
"Conference Room B, the last door on the left downstairs, is stale, dim and half-painted."
"The consulate is about 25 minutes by rideshare from Alden's high school."
"A hipster bakery selling matcha and vegan brownies is a few blocks away."
"Alden took classes here for weeks and traded his class in its trading room."
